  "scenario": [
    "A: search /a/search redirects to /a/detail/73; the final URL matches bookUrlPattern, so information is read from the search response and no list rule is read; the information cache supplies the detail page to the information stage; then TOC and content.",
    "B: /b/search does not match bookUrlPattern, so the list is read; the selected book is fetched, then TOC and content.",
    "C: no bookUrlPattern and an empty list; the search response is the information fallback, and its original request identity is the book URL; information is cached, then TOC and content.",
    "D: bookUrlPattern is nonempty but does not match /d/search, and the list is empty; the search result is the declared complete empty terminal, with no information/TOC/content requests."
  ],
